Unfortunately I do not think there is a simple way of applying WGT after the Laplace approx. in TMB (but it
would be great if I am wrong). A first step in the investigation is to sit down with pen and paper and
see exactly which term gets wrong if you try to apply WGT before the Laplace approximation.
The quantities needed in a correction ( a list of all log-det-hessians) is not available to the user (I think).

But at least a warning should be put in the documentation; it is very easy to make this mistake. (I will put it on my list docs-issues)

