So, the TMB wiki states that one shouldn't condition upon parameters.  This is due to the limitations of the AD engine.  However, CppAD offers CondExp <https://coin-or.github.io/CppAD/doc/condexp.htm> statements to deal with this; hence, I'm wondering if I can use CondExp statements with TMB parameters

